err_formtag.vuka:17:15: for on a <form> takes the form it renders: <form for={Form}>
err_formtag.vuka:21:28: an attribute set on a <form for={…}>: pass them as attrs={…}, a []ui.Attr
err_formtag.vuka:25:49: model on an <input type="hidden">: a form takes no value the visitor can't see or change (an id, an owner); take it from the route or the session, and leave the field out of the form with form:"-"
